    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">298.15-1500 K:</td><td> $Cp^o$  = 16.390 + 3.770x $10^{-3}$ T - 1.570x $10^5$ T $^{-2}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $H^o$ -  $H_{298}^o$  = 16.390x $10^{-3}$ T + 1.885x $10^{-6}$ T $^2$  + 1.570x $10^2$ T $^{-1}$  - 5.581</td></tr></table>\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">298.15-1500 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -74.488 + 2.371 \\times 10^{-3} T + 0.919 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 86.300 T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -74.488 - 2.371 \\times 10^{-3} T \\ln T - 0.919 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 43.150 T^{-1} + 65.649 \\times 10^{-3} T$ </td></tr></table>\nSource: Data from Mills (80) who estimated all except enthalpy of formation at 298 K. ",
